        },
        "subheading_1": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Soup Season started as Marlo filming Sunday lunch on a phone propped against the kettle. Now it is a weekly episode, a short podcast and a group of viewers who call themselves the Bowl Club.</p><p>Every episode ends the same way: a slurp, a verdict, and usually more salt.</p>",
            "size_desktop": 17,
            "size_mobile": 16
          }
        },
